From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Look step, BlackBerry 10 or BlackBerry 7 style

Plan phase C, optional look: a step before Theme (part of step 5, so the
count stays at 8; also in the secondary-user flow) offers BlackBerry 10
style or BlackBerry 7 style. There is no Plain look (owner decision
2026-11-05). Next:

* asks Sable Start for the home style with
  org.sableos.start.action.SET_LOOK (extra look: bb10 or bb7), which
  Start accepts only from a sender holding WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS;
* turns pure black on, which the Theme step after it shows and can
  still change;
* remembers the choice in Settings.Secure sable_look.

Nothing restarts, and each part stays its own setting afterwards.
Display density and the notification light are build settings and stay
as they are. Pure policy: sable/SableLook.java.
